Give me an extension, I can definitely keep going!

289
00:28:57,380 --> 00:29:01,380
君もヴァンパイア まずはこっちおいで
You're a vampire too, first come over here.

290
00:29:01,380 --> 00:29:10,380
ななななな ななななな ななななな ななななな
Na-na-na-na-na, na-na-na-na-na, na-na-na-na-na, na-na-na-na-na...

291
00:29:10,380 --> 00:29:12,880
絶対いけるよ
We can definitely make it!

292
00:29:36,180 --> 00:29:38,880
ねえ あたし知ってるよ
Hey, I know.

293
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:40,880
君が一人 知ってるの 知ってるよ
That you're alone, I know it, I know.

294
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:43,380
ビクンビクン震えてさ 声もダダ漏れなんだわ
Twitching and trembling, your voice is completely leaking out.

295
00:29:43,380 --> 00:29:45,880
正直に言っちゃえよ
Just say it honestly!

296
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:47,880
バレてるんだし言っちゃえよ 聞いてんの？
It's totally obvious, so confess! Are you listening?

297
00:29:47,880 --> 00:29:51,380
普通普通恥ずかしい みんな隠しているだけ むふっ
It's normal, normal to be embarrassed, everyone is just hiding it. Hehe.

298
00:29:57,880 --> 00:30:00,380
ねえ あたし知ってるよ 君が...
Hey, I know, that you're...

299
00:30:00,084 --> 00:30:02,884
君が一人涙してるの 知ってるよ
I know that you're crying all alone.

300
00:30:02,884 --> 00:30:05,484
くすんくすんへこんでさ 弱音吐くからいいんじゃない？
Sniffling and feeling down, isn't it okay to show your weakness?

301
00:30:05,484 --> 00:30:09,584
朝が来るまで一騎当千 もっと泣いたって 何度だって受け止めてあげる
A match for a thousand until morning comes; cry even more, I'll embrace it all again and again.

302
00:30:09,584 --> 00:30:12,784
もう我慢しないで いっぱい出してね
Don't hold back anymore, let it all out, okay?

303
00:30:12,784 --> 00:30:13,884
んー、まっ！
Mmh, mwah!

304
00:30:13,884 --> 00:30:16,784
お願い君が欲しいの 慰めさせて
Please, I want you; let me console you,

305
00:30:16,784 --> 00:30:19,484
Shake shake 愛の才能で
Shake, shake, with the talent of love.

306
00:30:19,484 --> 00:30:23,684
泣いてくれなきゃ 枯れてしまう 濡れていたい ねえいいでしょ？
If you don't cry for me, I'll wither away; I want to stay wet, hey, isn't that fine?

307
00:30:23,684 --> 00:30:27,584
舐め取って 飲み干したいんだってば
I'm telling you, I want to lick it all away and drink it dry.

308
00:30:27,584 --> 00:30:28,484
んー、まっ！
Mmh, mwah!

309
00:30:28,484 --> 00:30:30,884
お願い君が欲しいの 手折り散らして
Please, I want you; pluck and scatter me away,

310
00:30:30,884 --> 00:30:33,784
シック・ラップなんて最高ね
Chic wrap is the absolute best, isn't it?

311
00:30:33,784 --> 00:30:37,784
分けてくれなきゃ 君の痛い 感じてたい ねえいいでしょ？
If you don't share it with me... I want to feel your pain, hey, isn't that fine?

312
00:30:37,784 --> 00:30:42,084
吸い取って 救いたいんだってば
I'm telling you, I want to suck it out and save you.

313
00:30:48,084 --> 00:30:50,084
痛みたい 痛みたい 君の中
I want to hurt, I want to hurt inside of you...

314
00:30:50,084 --> 00:30:56,584
痛みたい 痛みたい...
I want to hurt, I want to hurt...

315
00:30:56,584 --> 00:31:00,384
ねえ あたし知ってるよ 君が一人悔しがってるの知ってるよ
Hey, I know; I know that you're feeling frustrated all alone.

316
00:31:00,384 --> 00:31:03,484
ずきゅんずきゅん高鳴るじゃん 君は推すことをやめない
My heart goes thump-thump racing, you won't stop supporting me.

317
00:31:03,484 --> 00:31:07,084
ねえ あたし知ってるよ 君はできる子 知ってるよ
Hey, I know; I know you're a capable one.

318
00:31:07,084 --> 00:31:10,884
辛い時は弱いぐらいで丁度いい あたしそれでも好きだよ
When it hurts, being a little weak is just right; I still love you all the same.

319
00:31:10,884 --> 00:31:11,984
んー、まっ！
Mmh, mwah!

320
00:31:11,984 --> 00:31:14,984
お願い君が欲しいの 名前を呼んでよ
Please, I want you; call out my name,

321
00:31:14,984 --> 00:31:17,384
いつだって愛に参上
Always arriving in the name of love.

322
00:31:17,384 --> 00:31:21,084
君は一人だ だから歌 独りじゃない
You're all alone—that's why a song! You're not alone.

323
00:31:21,084 --> 00:31:25,584
もういいでしょ？ ソロプレイはおしまいなんだってば
That's enough, right? I'm telling you, solo play is over.

324
00:31:26,084 --> 00:31:32,884
君がやめるときも あたしそばにいるわ
Even when you want to quit, I'll be by your side.

325
00:31:32,884 --> 00:31:37,084
いつも今も見守っているわ そうよ
Always, even now, I'm watching over you; that's right,

326
00:31:37,084 --> 00:31:41,584
怖くないのよ
There's nothing to fear!

327
00:31:43,884 --> 00:31:44,884
んー、まっ！
Mmh, mwah!

328
00:31:44,884 --> 00:31:47,584
お願い君が欲しいの 慰めさせて
Please, I want you; let me console you,

329
00:31:47,584 --> 00:31:50,484
Shake shake 愛の talents で
Shake, shake, with the talent of love.

330
00:31:50,484 --> 00:31:54,684
泣いてくれなきゃ 枯れてしまう 濡れていたい ねえいいでしょ？
If you don't cry for me, I'll wither away; I want to stay wet, hey, isn't that fine?

331
00:31:54,684 --> 00:31:58,584
舐め取って 飲み干したいんだってば
I'm telling you, I want to lick it all away and drink it dry.

332
00:31:58,584 --> 00:31:59,584
んー、まっ！
Mmh, mwah!

333
00:31:59,584 --> 00:32:02,084
お願い君が欲しいの 手折り散らして
Please, I want you; pluck and scatter me away,

334
00:32:02,084 --> 00:32:05,384
シック・ラップなんて最高ね
Chic wrap is the absolute best, isn't it?

335
00:32:05,384 --> 00:32:09,184
分けてくれなきゃ 君の痛い 感じてたい 覗いてたい
If you don't share it with me... I want to feel your pain, I want to peek inside.

336
00:32:09,184 --> 00:32:12,884
吸い取って 救いたいんだってば
I'm telling you, I want to suck it out and save you.

337
00:32:12,884 --> 00:32:16,884
ねえ あたし知ってるよ 君が一人涙してるの知ってるよ
Hey, I know; I know that you're crying all alone.

338
